EF**: Venezuelan bolivar - **VND**: Vietnamese dong - **VUV**: Vanuatu vatu - **WST**: Samoan tala - **XAF**: CFA franc BEAC - **XCD**: East Caribbean dollar - **XOF**: CFA franc BCEAO - **XPF**: CFP franc - **YER**: Yemeni rial - **ZAR**: South African rand - **ZMW**: Zambian kwacha - **ZWL**: Zimbabwean dollar
